# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Axe Fortress

step Azore Aldamort
  tip Azore's tower stands on the hill west of Thunder Axe Fortress: take his quest first, the sceptre he wants is in the fortress.
  accept 5741 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Karnitol's Chest
  tip The wrecked ship lies just south-west of Azore's tower; its chest sits beside Rackmore's Log.
  turnin 1454 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Karnitol's Chest
  accept 1455 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- For Kreldig Ungor, at the end of this guide
  accept 6161 -- Rackmore's Log, beside the chest: keep it, its keys and chest come on Desolace's south loop at the end of 30-40

step Dalinda Malem
  tip Dalinda hides inside the Burning Blade's fortress south-west of Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1438 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Inside
  accept 1439 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Tyranis and the Seer
  tip Her brother Tyranis (36) walks the fortress with the Burning Blade cultists (30-33): pull him alone. The Burning Blade Seer keeps the sceptre in the fortress's main building. Vahlarriel wants four of each kind of cultist on the way.
  collect 15750 quest 5741 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sceptre of Light; on the top floor
  kill 4663 quest 97284.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Burning Blade Augur
  kill 4664 quest 97284.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Burning Blade Reaver
  kill 4665 quest 97284.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Burning Blade Adept
  kill 4666 quest 97284.4 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Burning Blade Felsworn
  collect 6767 quest 1439 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Tyranis' Pendant; inside

